    "authors": "Dr. Alex Chen, Prof. Alistair Vance, and Dr. Julianna Ross",
    "affiliations": "Department of Computer Science, University of Oxford, UK; European Bioinformatics Institute (EMBL-EBI), Hinxton, Cambridge, UK",
