    "abstract": "Understanding the mechanistic molecular pathways of genetic and epigenetic regulation of hematopoietic lineage commitment is essential for developing targeted therapeutic strategies and precision diagnostics. In this study, we present multi-omic and clinical cohort analyses investigating cellular dynamics and functional phenotypes. Our findings reveal critical biomarker associations and provide actionable targets for translational intervention.",
